<title>UK: NatWest shares jump on bid talk.</title>
<headline>NatWest shares jump on bid talk.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in National Westminster Bank Plc rose in early trade on Monday after press speculation of a bid from or merger with banking rival Barclays Plc, dealers said.</p>
<p>The shares were up 30p to 776-1/2p by 0833 GMT.</p>
